# Desolation of Smaug's mana is "only to cast Dragon spells" (CR 106.6): Firdoch Core, a Kindred Artifact with changeling,
# is every creature type on the stack (CR 702.73a, 205.3m) - a Dragon spell though no creature spell - and is cast with
# three of the four red mana. Before that, the first Core's "{4}: becomes a 4/4" can't be activated: the restricted mana
# pays no ability, and Mox Jet with the Core's own mana ability make only two. The last red mana waits through the main
# phase and is gone in the next one (CR 106.4).

